<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/3fbb986f-77e1-411d-b906-c183480396dc.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="三色独立发光！小米首款RGBMini LED电视图赏" h="399" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/S3fbb986f-77e1-411d-b906-c183480396dc.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/fabe38f4-5147-406e-91aa-8f10571dcbb8.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="三色独立发光！小米首款RGBMini LED电视图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/Sfabe38f4-5147-406e-91aa-8f10571dcbb8.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/a98426d5-f24e-4e9c-859d-1ef7cb2dd6d0.png" target="_blank"><img alt="三色独立发光！小米首款RGBMini LED电视图赏" h="397" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260915/Sa98426d5-f24e-4e9c-859d-1ef7cb2dd6d0.png" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:40px 0px;"><hr align="center" color="#ccc" size="1" /></td>
